/*!
    \class ReuseStore
    \inmodule HiddenFriendsClassTemplate
    \brief A two-parameter template class documented with reused parameter names.

    The \a A and \a B parameters specify the key and value types.
*/

/*!
    \fn template <typename B, typename A> void reuseCheck(ReuseStore<B, A> &a, B key) noexcept

    Reused name binding marker. Checks \a a using \a key. The documentation
    reuses the class's parameter names in reversed declaration order while
    keeping the argument bindings consistent, so it documents the hidden friend.
*/
